        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tall thick blackrock walls extend thousands of li. The city sits on the upper half of Wan Cheng mountain, with rock houses and steel towers lined up toward the peak. On that peak stands the Demon Suppression Tower, a steel tower more than three hundred metres tall with almost a hundred floors, famous in the southern borders and all over the world, including middle continent.",
